            "review_title": "Review at Ollin Café",
            "review_text": "昕桐\nChina852 contributions\n0\nThe drinks are good.\nFeb 2026 • Family\nIt's already hot in Ho Chi Minh in February.\nI'm tired of hanging out. I'm thirsty. I'm naturally looking for a home break.\nRight next door to the home store.\nA lot of people, but still lucky enough to be there when there was room.\nOrdered two coffee specials and lychee and lemon tea.\nThe cakes are average, the drinks are delicious.\nAnd it's very comfortable to decorate, with lots of people sitting in office.\nRead more\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten March 4, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
