            "review_text": "Nitin\n5 contributions\n1\nOllin Cafe is one of the best\nDec 2019 • Friends\nOllin Cafe is one of the best cafes I have ever visited. It is a huge space with airy open Scandinavian style interiors. I loved their Coconut Coffee. The presentation is unique and the quality of coffee is one of the best in Vietnam. I liked their attention to details and their conscious effort to use organic plant straws instead of plastic straws impressed me a lot.\nRead more\nWritten December 4, 2019\nOllin Café Premium\nThank you for your review, Nitin! Hope you have a great time in Viet Nam\nWritten February 21, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
